OL,3,GNEWSALegally Blonde turns 25: Meet the
OL,4,Alawyers inspired by Reese Witherspoon's
OL,5,AElle Woods
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has been 25 years since Elle Woods
OL,8,Fstomped her 'last season Prada shoes'
OL,9,Facross UK screens in Legally Blonde.
OL,11,FThe film, which was released 25 years
OL,12,Fago today, sees Woods played by Reese
OL,13,FWitherspoon, enrol in Harvard Law
OL,14,FSchool after her boyfriend dumps her
OL,15,Ffor not being serious enough. The film
OL,16,Fwent on to inspire generations of
OL,17,Fwould-be lawyers and solicitors.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
