OL,3,GNEWSALegally Blonde turns 25: Meet the
OL,4,Alawyers inspired by Reese Witherspoon's
OL,5,AElle Woods
OL,6,
OL,7,FA quarter of a century later, women now
OL,8,Foutnumber men in the legal industry.
OL,9,FAnd while "the Legally Blonde effect"
OL,10,Fmay not be the sole reason for the
OL,11,Fboost, lawyers say it has not hurt the
OL,12,Fcause.
OL,14,F"It definitely inspired the kind of
OL,15,Flawyer I wanted to be," trainee
OL,16,Fsolicitor Olivia Holder said.
